    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Hah. You've gotten used to my piggyback rides?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Hah. You've gotten used to my piggyback rides?"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Don't look at me like that. How many times have we been treated like this? It's no big deal.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Don't look at me like that. How many times have we been treated like this? It's no big deal."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Let's head to Waang Saan Plaza in District 16. If Reunion wants to break through the line, that's where they'll have to do it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Let's head to Waang Saan Plaza in District 16. If Reunion wants to break through the line, that's where they'll have to do it."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  If we're going to wipe out Reunion's main force, we can't let any of them slip through our zone of control.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "If we're going to wipe out Reunion's main force, we can't let any of them slip through our zone of control."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  The way Amiya and the cranky old cop lady worked it out, we'll just be whittling them away little by little until we can finally wipe them all out in one swift stroke.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "The way Amiya and the cranky old cop lady worked it out, we'll just be whittling them away little by little until we can finally wipe them all out in one swift stroke."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  So we go chase the bad guys out of Waang Saan Tower, herd them into a pincer attack, then meet up with Amiya and crush Reunion once and for all. Piece of cake, right?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "So we go chase the bad guys out of Waang Saan Tower, herd them into a pincer attack, then meet up with Amiya and crush Reunion once and for all. Piece of cake, right?"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  ...You and your faces. I told you I'm fine.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "...You and your faces. I told you I'm fine."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Fine. If you keep staring at me like that, I'm pulling this cat over.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Fine. If you keep staring at me like that, I'm pulling this cat over."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Hold on tight.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Hold on tight."
