        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  If she turned... Well, I don't even want to think about it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "If she turned... Well, I don't even want to think about it."
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  If she betrayed us, then there's absolutely no one left in Lungmen we can trust.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "If she betrayed us, then there's absolutely no one left in Lungmen we can trust."
